#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/feedback.md:7
msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "フィードバック"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/feedback.md:9
msgid ""
"Feedback is the contract that passes observations associated with "
"candidates in a form the Algorithm can use. It matches records by "
"subject, candidate ID, proposal relation, sequence, status, source, and "
"completion semantics rather than by row position. Partial, out-of-order, "
"and repeated observations for the same candidate are valid inputs."
msgstr "フィードバックは、候補に対応する観測をアルゴリズムが利用できる形で渡す契約です。行位置ではなく、対象、候補ID、提案関係、順序、状態、出所、完了の意味論でレコードを対応付けます。同じ候補に対する部分的な観測、順不同の観測、繰り返しの観測も有効な入力です。"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/feedback.md:13
msgid "Feedback's role"
msgstr "Feedbackの役割"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/feedback.md:15
msgid ""
"Feedback passes observations associated with candidates in a form the "
"Algorithm can use. It does not generate candidate representations or "
"recalculate whether observations are correct."
msgstr "候補に対応する観測値を、アルゴリズムが利用できるフィードバックへ渡します。候補の表現を生成したり、観測値の正しさを再計算したりする責務は持ちません。"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/feedback.md:17
msgid "Proposals and observations"
msgstr "提案と観測"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/feedback.md:19
msgid ""
"`ProposalBatch` collects candidates, relations among candidates, and the "
"Feedback quantities they require. `ObservationBatch` contains an "
"observation schema and records, representing quantities such as "
"objectives, constraints, features, and costs together with their source "
"and status. When the quantities requested by a proposal and provided by "
"an observation batch are available, the proposal can proceed to later "
"Feedback processing."
msgstr ""
"`ProposalBatch` は候補と候補間の関係、必要なフィードバック量をまとめます。 `ObservationBatch` "
"は観測スキーマと観測レコードを持ち、目的、制約、特徴、コストなどの量を観測の出所と状態とともに表します。 "
"提案が要求する量と、観測バッチが提供する量が揃ったとき、提案は後続のフィードバック処理へ進めます。"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/feedback.md:23
msgid "Feedback on the graph-native path"
msgstr "graph-native経路のFeedback"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/feedback.md:25
msgid ""
"`FeedbackBatch` is the observation batch delivered for one proposal. "
"`ObservationBatch` holds the subject, quantity, status, and source of "
"each observation record, while `FeedbackBatch` adds the proposal ID, "
"channel, sequence, and final flag. The consumer declares ordering, "
"completion, multiplicity, and grouping in `FeedbackContract`. "
"`FeedbackBuilder` is the boundary that projects observations into the "
"dense `FeedbackResult` form."
msgstr "`FeedbackBatch`は一つの提案に対して届けられた観測バッチです。`ObservationBatch`は観測レコードの対象、量、状態、出所を保持し、`FeedbackBatch`は提案ID、チャネル、順序、最終フラグを加えます。利用側は`FeedbackContract`で順序、完了、多重度、グループ化を宣言します。`FeedbackBuilder`は観測を`FeedbackResult`の密な形へ投影する境界です。"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/feedback.md:30
msgid "FeedbackResult on the Stage compatibility path"
msgstr "Stage互換経路のFeedbackResult"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/feedback.md:32
msgid ""
"`FeedbackResult` is the dense compatibility data type passed to the "
"Algorithm's `tell`. In this type, `candidate_ids` are unique, and the "
"`f`, `g`, `cv`, `evaluated_mask`, `source`, and artifacts arrays follow "
"the same row-count and shape rules. This constrains row consistency "
"within `FeedbackResult`; it does not require row order to match an "
"external `ObservationBatch`."
msgstr "`FeedbackResult`はAlgorithmの`tell`へ渡す密な互換データ型です。この型では`candidate_ids`が一意で、`f`、`g`、`cv`、`evaluated_mask`、`source`、artifactsの各配列が同じ行数・形状規則に従います。これは`FeedbackResult`内の行の整合性を制約しますが、外部の`ObservationBatch`と行順を一致させる必要はありません。"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/feedback.md:36
msgid "What Feedback holds"
msgstr "Feedbackが保持するもの"

